# The story's arc (docs/guide/journey.md). Rendered to journey.svg by go generate.
title: The journey from an idea to a measured release, in nine chapters
direction: down
shape: 1. The goal: grill goal
breakdown: 2. The plan: slice, plan
ready: 3. The promises: grill story, ready
build: 4. The build: build
prove: 5. The gate says no: verify, inspect
ship: 6. The yes: ship
release: 7. The release: release
learn: 8. The number: measure, retro
explain: 9. The telling: brief, tell
shape -> breakdown
breakdown -> ready
ready -> build: you say Ready
build -> prove
prove -> build: fix
prove -> ship: you give the yes
ship -> release
release -> learn
learn -> explain
learn -> shape: the next goal
